## API FUNDAMENTALS

### Base URL
  https://{{SANDFLY_HOST}}/v4/

### Authentication — JWT Bearer Token (session-based)
  Step 1 — Login to get access token:
    POST https://{{SANDFLY_HOST}}/v4/auth/login
    Content-Type: application/json
    Body: {"username": "{{SANDFLY_USER}}", "password": "{{SANDFLY_PASS}}"}

  Response contains:
    { "access_token": "<JWT>", "token_type": "bearer" }

  Step 2 — Use token on all subsequent calls:
    Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

  Token refresh:
    POST https://{{SANDFLY_HOST}}/v4/auth/login/refresh

  Logout (revoke token):
    DELETE https://{{SANDFLY_HOST}}/v4/auth/logout

  ⚠ Tokens are session-bound — obtain a fresh token at the start of each automation run.
  ⚠ All API calls should only be made from internal network. Never expose the Sandfly server
    directly to the internet.

### Standard request pattern
  curl -s -k \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer {{SANDFLY_TOKEN}}" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    https://{{SANDFLY_HOST}}/v4/<path>

  -k skips TLS verification for self-signed certs (homelab default).

