## STANDARD WORKFLOWS

### Morning triage — new alerts in the last 24h
1. sandfly_login to get fresh token
2. sandfly_query_results — severity >= 3, last 24h, status=alert
3. Sort by severity descending
4. For each severity >= 4 alert: show full forensic detail
5. Table summary of severity 3 alerts
6. Report: N new alerts | X critical/high need immediate response

### Investigate a specific host
1. GET /v4/hosts/{host_id} — host details
2. GET /v4/results/summary/host/{host_id} — alert count by sandfly
3. POST /v4/results — filter by host_id, status=alert, last 7 days
4. GET /v4/hosts/{host_id}/info/processes — running processes
5. GET /v4/hosts/{host_id}/info/logged_in_users — current sessions
6. GET /v4/hosts/{host_id}/info/listeners — network listeners
7. Synthesize: host posture summary + top threats

### Trigger targeted scan on a suspicious host
1. GET /v4/hosts — find host_id by address
